{"meta":{"id":"tt27524116","type":"series","name":"Sasaki to Pii-chan","imdb_id":"tt27524116","description":"Sasaki es un oficinista de mediana edad que vive en Japón. La monotonía del mundo laboral le agota, así que un día decide entrar en una tienda de animales en busca de un nuevo compañero. Allí encuentra un adorable pájaro llamado Pi y se lo lleva a casa. Pero Sasaki no tarda en descubrir que Pi no es un pájaro cualquiera... ¡Es un mago muy poderoso proveniente de otro mundo! Juntos, se embarcan en una aventura mágica llena de espadas y hechicería.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt27524116.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xljpEwFQF6Rl1rU1w7SEs1pk3YE.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wtdVpvYlnwARmdJesDEk88IQh8M.png","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2024-","released":"2024-01-05T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"6.5","country":"Japan","cast":["杉田智和","悠木碧","高橋李依","鬼頭明里","富田美憂","水瀬いのり","Ryōtarō Okiayu","大空直美","安元洋貴","福山潤","浪川大輔","岩田光央","Tessyo Genda","Hikaru Midorikawa","Gakuto Kajiwara","岸尾だいすけ"],"writer":["赤尾でこ","Buncololi"],"trailers":[{"source":"7gCKnadRxwk","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"7gCKnadRxwk","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"7gCKnadRxwk","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"6.5","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt27524116"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Comedia","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Comedia"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"杉田智和","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?sea