ai (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/kUer38jXf7vTD2TGGxJMZVYL5Te.jpg","tmdbId":1919881},{"name":"岸尾だいすけ","character":"Maximilian (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/cH2JIa3Uc2k95yIuB462GwocPuT.jpg","tmdbId":115302}],"writers":[{"name":"赤尾でこ","character":"赤尾でこ","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/sOKxl6uLAJpkGTa7JPu1YXG0ZaP.jpg","tmdbId":1149042},{"name":"Buncololi","character":"Buncololi","photo":null,"tmdbId":4379829}],"certification":"B-15","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3D7giT0fyJJ5ssjOEhYgUXN7Sg.jpg","https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/season/2119530/posters/6acac1aee4544.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt27524116:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"1. La realidad y otro mundo","overview":"Sasaki es un trabajador normal y corriente con una vida aburrida. A sus cerca de 40 años, decide comprarse un gorrión de Java como mascota, pero lo que no espera es que su nuevo pájaro hable y resulte ser un sabio de otro mundo reencarnado que pondrá su tediosa vida patas arriba.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9914462/screencap/65957c790ae2a.jpg","released":"2024-01-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"2. Un primer trabajo y una compañera","overview":"Sasaki comienza en su nuevo trabajo. Su primera misión le servirá para conocer a qué se enfrentará a partir de ahora y a complementarse con su nueva compañera.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190379/screencap/65a00bdb6a511.jpg","released":"2024-01-12T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"3. La guerra y la señorita","overview":"Una guerra ha estallado entre dos naciones vecinas y el vizconde Müller requiere los servicios de Sasaki para llevarle suministros a su país.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190380/screencap/65a9a8a6599b1.jpg","released":"2024-01-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"4. El príncipe y el sabio","overview":"Sin el señor de la familia Müller, se avecina una pelea entre hermanos para hacerse con el control de la familia y, mientras ocurra, Sasaki tiene el deber de proteger a Elsa.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190381/screencap/65b26f4b9461a.jpg","released":"2024-01-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"5. Un hombre mágico y un tercer mundo","overview":"En el mundo real, la vecina de Sasaki se preocupa por su posible desaparación, mientras que Hoshizaki le requiere para seguir reclutando a psíquicos.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190382/screencap/65bbaa608f8de.jpg","released":"2024-02-02T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. Entrevista y entretenimiento","overview":"Shizuka le propone a Sasaki unirse a su oficina, pero antes debe entrevistarse con el jefe para ganarse su confianza.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190383/screencap/65c582a08be56.jpg","released":"2024-02-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. Fuerza marcial y política","overview":"De vuelta al otro mundo, las fuerzas de Dietrich amenazan al conde Müller y a Sasaki, que tendrán que pensar en cómo evitar más conflictos de los que ya tienen los reinos de ese mundo.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190384/screencap/65ce289c6e15d.jpg","released":"2024-02-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Dudas y turismo","overview":"Para liberar a Marc, Sasaki tiene que reunir fondos. Para ello, ha regresado a su propio mundo con oro, pero no había contado con que Lady Elsa se inmiscuyera, ni con que Shizuka Futari intentara atacarla... ¡Sus problemas no han hecho más que empezar!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190385/screencap/65d77360cea6b.jpg","released":"2024-02-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"9. Ejecución y negociaciones","overview":"Sasaki y el conde siguen trabajando para liberar a Marc, pero para ello tendrán que negociar con el conde Dietrich.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190386/screencap/65e1d20204a98.jpg","released":"2024-03-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"10. Valor y dignidad","overview":"Sasaki, Dietrich y Müller se reúnen para negociar una salida satisfactoria para el asunto de Marc.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190387/screencap/65ea4c316af60.jpg","released":"2024-03-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"11. Fantasía y captura","overview":"Sasaki, Pi y Shizuka se encuentran por sorpresa a un alto cargo de la organización enemiga.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190388/screencap/65f453ee38716.jpg","released":"2024-03-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"12. El presente, el otro mundo y un cuarto mundo","overview":"La chica mágica está atacando la oficina y viene acompañada. Akutsu pide a Sasaki y Shizuka que la atrapen de una vez por todas.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10190389/screencap/65fd7d19156f2.jpg","released":"2024-03-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"13. Madre e hija","overview":"La vecina de Sasaki explica su situación personal y la relación que tiene con su madre.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10403397/screencap/6ac5933cf3d75.jpg","released":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"14. Juegos mortales y demonios","overview":"Sasaki y Shizuka se acercan a investigar qué altercados está provocando la chica mágica.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12012550/screencap/6acec50274553.jpg","released":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"15. Escondite e infiltración","overview":"Tras lo ocurrido con Elsa, Müller, Sasaki y Pi preparan un plan para evitar más desgracias.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12012551/screencap/6ad8196b50c12.jpg","released":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"16. El ángel y el joven","overview":"Sasaki se ve arrastrado a un espacio aislado sin Pi y contra un ángel que quiere acabar con él.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12012552/screencap/6ae00456d348a.jpg","released":"2026-10-28T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"17. Héroe y sentimientos","overview":"Abaddon intenta hacer lo que puede por sacar a Sasaki y su vecina de la guerra contra los ángeles.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12012553/screencap/6aea9caa2b4a4.jpg","released":"2026-11-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"18. Fiestas y lazos","overview":"Una fiesta de bienvenida se alarga más de la cuenta y a Sasaki lo espera una sorpresa en su baronía.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12012554/screencap/6af31374d27be.jpg","released":"2026-11-11T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"19. Episode 7","released":"2026-11-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt27524116:2:8","season":2,"episode":8,"title":"20. Episode 8","released":"20